--- !u!114 &968035054
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 968035053}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8fbe01c4175af04e8fc19c9c4bcddb5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SiloEncounter
  player: {fileID: 392070928}
  movement: {fileID: 392070927}
  health: {fileID: 392070935}
  gun: {fileID: 436781898}
  fader: {fileID: 829797400}
  siloCenter: {fileID: 83538037}
  throwDistance: 2.8
  throwLift: 1.5
  killer: {fileID: 2143736379}
  killerLandPoint: {fileID: 1401917360}
  derekDeath: {fileID: 0}
  sfx: {fileID: 968035057}
  thudClip: {fileID: 0}
  gunProp: {fileID: 271648774}
  gunThrowFrom: {fileID: 1358331870}
  bossAutoStart: 8
  choicePanel: {fileID: 327759062}
  keysPickup: {fileID: 871646147}
  flood: {fileID: 968035055}
  pushLine: ...footsteps. Right behind me.
  leapLine: The stairs just... stop.|No. No no no-- JUMP!
  landLine: Agh... my leg... I can't feel my leg...
  derekDeathLine: 'Elias: Tomas keeps bringing me back here. Where I killed them.|Elias:
    He told me to take your keys from the red office after we fell. To stop you leaving.|Elias:
    Your name was the last one. I couldn''t do it while you held Derek. But I can
    now.'
  throwLine: 'Maya: That voice - you''re my driver! From the radio!|Maya: Elias left
    this rifle after he killed us. CATCH!'
  gunLine: Elias's rifle. Maya took it from the landing.
  defeatedLine: 'He drops to his knees, blood running down his face.|Elias: Go on.
    Finish it. You people are good at that.'
  killTalkLine: 
  mayaTurnsOnKill: 1
  killMayaLine: 
  killLine: 'The shape tears apart. Elias is gone. No hearing. No way back.|His coat
    falls open. My van keys.|A photograph: TOMAS ROURKE. On the back: ''The last
    name. Stop him leaving.'''
  spareLine: 'Elias: I got Tomas the cleaner''s job. After he died, I could see him.|Elias:
    He gave me the names. I called it justice. It was murder. I killed Maya and Sam
    in this silo. Vane in the tunnel. Derek in your home.|Elias: They were people.
    I chose to do it. Tomas didn''t hold the knife for me.|The red is leaving his
    skin. He''s coming back.'
  mayaSnapLine: 'Maya: Don''t listen to him! I called Vane when Tomas told me about
    the bodies.|Maya: I knew what Vane would do. But I had a job to keep! We ALL
    did!|Maya: Tomas deserved it for putting us at risk. I won''t apologise!'
  mayaRealiseLine: 'Maya: I was RIGHT. You hear me? I was RIGHT!'
  mayaTurnedLine: She's clinging to the excuse. It's tearing her shape apart.|Elias
    confessed. Maya won't. That's the difference.
  eliasSaveLine: 'Elias: I won''t let another person die for my brother. GO!'
  eliasKeysLine: 'Elias: The keys - take them! Get Sam out!|He took them from my
    desk AFTER the fall. On Tomas''s orders.'
  twistFloodLine: The grates-- that's BLOOD. It's coming up fast!
  keysLine: My car keys. He had them the whole time.
  confessionLine: 'Maya: I know your voice. I sent your route over the radio before
    Sam loaded you at eleven.|Sam: Elias followed us in here with the rifle. He kept
    saying ''Tomas'' to someone we couldn''t see.|Maya: We died on these stairs before
    quarter past six. We woke down here. Our fear kept us solid.|Sam: That report
    was a shift witness statement. We all signed. I didn''t see an accident. I lied.'
  floodLine: The grates... that's blood. It's filling up.|SWIM!
  onLanded:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 969224534}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: Checkpoint, Assembly-CSharp
        m_MethodName: Activate
        m_Mode: 1
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: 
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: 
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
  fightMagSize: 15
  outLine: I'm out!
  mayaMagLines:
  - 'Maya: Catch! The mag!'
  - 'Maya: Here! Don''t miss it this time!'
  - 'Maya: Another one-- GO GET IT!'
  - 'Maya: Incoming! Make it count!'
  magMinFromPlayer: 2.5
